{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">上水低密度豪宅屋苑奕翠園憑藉環境清幽寧靜、會所設施齊備，持續吸引首置客入市。利嘉閣地產上水-上水中心分行首席聯席董事黃靜顏表示，該行團隊精英最新促成上水奕翠園7座中層B室連一車位的二手成交個案，面積約942呎，採三房套連士多房間隔，外望開揚景致。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">黃靜顏透露，買家為首置客，早前透過利嘉閣真盤源平台獲安排參觀上述放盤。客人鍾情屋苑居住環境寧靜舒適，加上單位景致開揚，配合三房大氣方正開則及連車位，極為符合家庭需求，睇樓後感到十分滿意，遂決定洽商議購。業主原以980萬元放售單位，議價後以922萬元連一車位購入，折合實用面積呎價約9,788元，屬市场合理水平。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">據悉，原業主於1996年以約389.64萬元一手購入上述單位，持貨長達30年轉手，帳面大幅獲利約533萬元，單位期內升值約1.37倍。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T10:58:23.052667+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}